Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}助太刀するぜ　遊馬！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来帮你 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}お…　お前！？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}アンナ！？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}お前　なんでここに！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么会在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}説明はあとだ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释待会儿再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}とにかくコイツをぶっ潰す！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之先把这家伙干掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}いっけ～　ロケットアロー！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧～ 火箭箭！
